# Supabase (publishable key — safe for client; RLS controls access)
#
# Read at BUILD time and baked into the static bundle, so they must be present
# wherever `pnpm generate` runs — locally, and in Cloudflare Workers Builds if
# you deploy via git push.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your-publishable-key
